-  "why_it_is_squared": "per-level charge is a DIFFERENCE of cumulative CHARGED counts (scorecard.py:479 `level_actions = actions_at_level - prev_actions`), and the per-level score is min((baseline/level_actions)**2 * 100, 115) (:168-171) -- so a reset taken BEFORE a level-up lands in that level's denominator and is squared",
